                            {
                                "example_id": "8db5ae8b-c28c-415a-946e-a66e8156fdf0",
                                "sense_id": "b9b18baf-44ae-3639-adea-6cc2e97a41a0",
                                "text": "Claudette Colbert, sensitive about certain camera angles “killed” one photographer’s entire sitting. (“Not temperament, just smart,” said the lensman, who is one of the best.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "022e56e5-ec71-4a1b-bdff-73fa36a62708",
                                "sense_id": "b9b18baf-44ae-3639-adea-6cc2e97a41a0",
                                "text": "Famed lensman Richardson shot the campaign for the past three years, and drew criticism for depicting uber-skinny female models in body-baring clothing with male models in suggestive positions."
